make it so.What's coming:• A brand-new mid-game chapter, \"Interception\": a new location, new threats and a turn you won't see coming• Japanese voice acting by Japanese voice actresses• More polish, performance and fixes based on your demo feedbackThe ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-25T06:39:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114041315","verified_at":"2026-10-25T10:25:04Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4858340-1844115010488852","game_id":"steam-4858340","kind":"update","title":"General Update: Reworked Document Reader, Darker Visuals, New English VO","summary":"New demo build is up before Next Fest, with a few things worth mentioning.The document/lore reader got a full visual pass — a proper terminal-style frame, a page gauge instead of a bare counter, and a typewriter-style text reveal with a bit of CRT glitch on page turns. It also fixed a font issue that made some text render in the wrong typeface.The game's visual tone overall reads darker now, tightening the atmosphere throughout.The English voiceover was also fully replaced — new actress, and the","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-16T11:34:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010488852","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:03:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4858340-1843481262691726","game_id":"steam-4858340","kind":"announcement","title":"Streaming & Video Guidelines","summary":"You are welcome to record and stream IRONWAKE, both the demo and the full game.Allowed: gameplay videos and live streams on any platform, monetization through ads, memberships, donations and superchats, coverage by individual and corporate creators alike. Spoilers are at your discretion. No permission re